<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 200 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK SELLS PLN 200 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 200 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills and set the minimum price at 86.85 after investors bid for 323 million zlotys of the paper, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The averge yield of the 273-day paper was 19.95 percent, up O.O2 point from the last auction on October 2.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
